{# hKask v0.31.0 — Swarm Intelligence #}
{#
  Classify the gap between sensed state and target condition. The gap falls
  into one of three deficit classes, each rooted in a different ontology:
  variety deficit (Ashby requisite variety), coherence deficit (PSO/ACO
  premature convergence + Thagard), loop-break (cybernetic 5-property
